e; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 6 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 31 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 20:45 \u2022 \u26f0\ufe0f 150 m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Adultos (> 12 anos):<\/strong> 10,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 25\/10\/2026 (inclui lembran\u00e7a e ceia))<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Jovens (at\u00e9 12 anos):<\/strong> 6,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 25\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trilhos do Nab\u00e3o - Corrida das Bruxas 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se na noite de s\u00e1bado, 31 de outubro de 2026, com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0s 18:30 e partidas no Sal\u00e3o Multiusos da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural e Recreativa da Linhaceira, no concelho de Tomar (distrito de Santar\u00e9m).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os hor\u00e1rios de partida de cada prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa integra duas dist\u00e2ncias noturnas: o Trail de 15 km (400 m D+, Grau 2 ATRP), com partida \u00e0s 20:30, e a Caminhada de 6 km (150 m D+), com partida \u00e0s 20:45. O tempo limite m\u00e1ximo \u00e9 de 3h00 e a entrega de pr\u00e9mios inicia-se \u00e0s 22:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 25 de outubro de 2026 com o valor de 14,00 \u20ac para o Trail de 15 km (inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica) e 10,00 \u20ac para a Caminhada de 6 km (6,00 \u20ac para menores at\u00e9 12 anos). Todas as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es incluem dorsal, seguro, abastecimentos, banhos e ceia final com caldo verde, p\u00e3o com chouri\u00e7o e bebida.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no Sal\u00e3o Multiusos da A.C.R. da Linhaceira na sexta-feira, 30 de outubro, das 18:00 \u00e0s 21:00, e no dia da prova (s\u00e1bado, 31 de outubro), das 17:30 \u00e0s 20:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio para participar nesta prova noturna?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No Trail de 15 km \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de luz frontal funcional, dorsal vis\u00edvel, telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito e copo ou recipiente para l\u00edquidos (35 cl min.), uma vez que a prova decorre em semi-autossufici\u00eancia sem copos descart\u00e1veis nos postos de abastecimento.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trilhos do Nab\u00e3o - Corrida das Bruxas 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-31\", \"endDate\": \"2026-10-31\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Linhaceira, Tomar\", \"addr